id=hyperos_torch_255
name=HyperOS Control Center Torch 255
version=1.5.0
versionCode=150
author=E3N
description=Pure Magisk/systemless HyperOS torch enhancement: 500 mA Camera HAL ceiling, PowerKeeper-only filtering of the OEM early torch thermal state while the torch is active, and an 80 C / 75 C brightness hysteresis governor. No LSPosed/Zygisk/Xposed hook; kernel and PMIC final protections remain authoritative; uninstall + reboot restores stock.
